WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:04.610
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and now that
Arrow is officially on break it’s time to

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:05.750
talk about season 3.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.850
The cast has already started teasing what
the characters are going to be doing and Stephen

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:09.820
Amell even talked a little about the new main
villain.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.590
So what I’m going to do is an early breakdown
of what everyone on the show has been saying

00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:14.050
and what it might mean.

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:17.052
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do DC and Marvel videos every week, this

00:00:17.052 --> 00:00:21.740
week is extra special because of Days of Future
Past this week.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:29.650
So be sure to subscribe to get everything
and leave me suggestions for bonus vids to

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:30.650
do.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:35.280
So these 10 things aren’t in any particular
order, but I’m starting off with the fun

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.280
stuff.

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:38.560
Careful for spoilers from Arrow Season 2 if
you haven’t seen it.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:41.980
Here we go 1st - Merlyn will not be the main
villain.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:44.280
But he will be sticking it to Team Arrow.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:48.750
So you can think of him as more of an antagonist
and if we’re lucky an anti-hero.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.520
If you’re not familiar with the term, it
just means he’s a bad guy that the writers

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:53.140
want us to root for.

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:55.329
And he’s John Barrowman, how could you not
root for him?

00:00:55.329 --> 00:00:59.969
Merlyn and Oliver aren’t enemies the way
Slade as Oliver’s enemy, but John Barrowman

00:00:59.969 --> 00:01:02.149
is much better with long speeches and subtelty.

00:01:02.149 --> 00:01:06.659
As opposed to Manu Bennett, who’s just much
more of a big physically imposing guy in the

00:01:06.659 --> 00:01:08.329
Schwarzenegger tradition.

00:01:08.329 --> 00:01:12.950
So we’re going to see a lot more dinner
scenes like this between Oliver and Brother

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:13.950
Blood.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:18.139
The immovable object meets the unstoppable
force for chinese takeout.

00:01:18.139 --> 00:01:22.639
That being the case, I’d recommend you go
back and watch some of Merlyn’s speeches

00:01:22.639 --> 00:01:23.899
from season 1.

00:01:23.899 --> 00:01:27.200
Especially starting at around episode 13.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:31.340
I don’t want to do Manu any disservice,
but John Barrowman is much closer to say,

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.659
like a Tom Hiddleston Loki, than Bane.

00:01:34.659 --> 00:01:35.990
They both have their specialties.

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:39.009
Captain Jack is just a more devilish playful
villain.

00:01:39.009 --> 00:01:43.539
But now Merlyn has no more reason to hide
his secret identity as the Dark Archer, so

00:01:43.539 --> 00:01:46.869
he’ll be much more direct in the way he
acts against Oliver and Team Arrow.

00:01:46.869 --> 00:01:50.579
Number 2 - Merlyn will be getting a new costume

00:01:50.579 --> 00:01:55.789
John Barrowman is a cast regular this season,
which is an upgrade from being a guest actor.

00:01:55.789 --> 00:01:59.299
It means he gets paid a ton more and gets
to be in way more episodes.

00:01:59.299 --> 00:02:01.159
He’ll be one of the core characters.

00:02:01.159 --> 00:02:02.959
Even more so than in Season 1.

00:02:02.959 --> 00:02:08.009
He was asked what he wanted now that he had
all this newfound importance and he said a

00:02:08.009 --> 00:02:09.629
less claustrophobic costume.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:12.640
He said he wanted a black version of Oliver’s
costume.

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:14.790
I wonder if he also meant black leather pants?

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:17.080
I can already hear the jokes.

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:20.329
Whatever his Dark Archer costume ends up being,
it will be super cool.

00:02:20.329 --> 00:02:22.790
But plan on some new evil guy threads for
his new expanded role.

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:28.709
Number 3 - Felicity is going to get herself
into a lot more trouble

00:02:28.709 --> 00:02:32.599
When you have a super powered boyfriend like
The Flash, you get to take more risks.

00:02:32.599 --> 00:02:34.349
Just ask Lois Lane.

00:02:34.349 --> 00:02:38.689
She used to almost get killed every week before
DC retconned her relationship with Superman.

00:02:38.689 --> 00:02:41.959
We’re also going to learn a lot more about
Felicity’s backstory.

00:02:41.959 --> 00:02:48.829
My early theories are that they’ll incorporate
a few elements of the comic book version of

00:02:48.829 --> 00:02:53.599
her character and just do that Laurel thing
where they twist it into a much more practical

00:02:53.599 --> 00:02:54.599
thing.

00:02:54.599 --> 00:03:00.640
So in the comics for example, she’s the
mother of one half of Firestorm.

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:04.450
If you don’t know who Firestorm is, he’s
a superhero that’s made up of two different

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:06.379
people and the Firestorm Matrix.

00:03:06.379 --> 00:03:11.959
It’s like this timey wimey construct whereby
two people become one and they can just disassemble

00:03:11.959 --> 00:03:14.220
and reassemble matter into whatever they want.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:18.230
I do not see Arrow doing that anytime soon.

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:24.650
But they could pull a few easter eggs from
the Firestorm or Justice League universe.

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:28.580
Like tying her father and mother to other
known organizations like ARGUS or HIVE.

00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:33.180
Good or Bad, there’s no way Felicity’s
parents are going to be boring normal people.

00:03:33.180 --> 00:03:38.379
Quentin holds the distinction of being the
most normal Dad on the show.

00:03:38.379 --> 00:03:41.170
No one is going to swoop in and take that
from him.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:44.379
Number 4 - Thea will Train With Merlyn

00:03:44.379 --> 00:03:48.800
John Barrowman also talked about how Thea
is going to learn to be tougher as she said

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:49.800
during the finale.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:53.230
He wasn’t explicit on how he was going to
help her become tougher.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:57.659
But she will be physically and mentally training
and possible sticking it to Team Arrow and

00:03:57.659 --> 00:04:01.499
the people who have been lying to her for
so long.

00:04:01.499 --> 00:04:05.329
AKA Oliver and Roy.

00:04:05.329 --> 00:04:08.080
Mostly Roy though.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.999
So look forward to their relationship going
to a really weird place.

00:04:10.999 --> 00:04:12.750
They still really care about each other.

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.769
So when they fight it will be like Batman
fighting Talia.

00:04:15.769 --> 00:04:18.930
Roy is way less cynical than Batman, but you
get the idea.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:23.930
A lot of you were asking me about Thea’s
persona and suggesting Cheshire.

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:28.440
Anything is possible, but the first half of
the season all I’m expecting is the same

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:30.230
thing they’ve been doing with Laurel recently.

00:04:30.230 --> 00:04:35.790
Not focusing on comic book names, just showing
her using weapons with more and more confidence.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:42.470
I think it’s going to take Thea all season
to even get close to a comic book persona.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:44.849
Think about how long it took Roy to get his
mask.

00:04:44.849 --> 00:04:47.860
And no one has even called him by a superhero
name yet.

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:49.450
So even he hasn’t got a persona.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:54.080
Even though the producers have said he’s
the Arsenal version of Roy Harper.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:56.800
No one on the show has said it during an episode
yet.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:00.030
Number 5 - Roy Will Be Arsenal Full Time

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:04.870
Now that the distraction formerly known as
Thea is out of his life, as far as he knowns.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:08.990
He’ll do what every dude does and just throw
himself into his work so he won’t have to

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.040
think about her.

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.680
Until she starts shooting arrows at his face.

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:16.699
Because he gets to be Arsenal all season,
I’m expecting his side plot to go to Bludhaven

00:05:16.699 --> 00:05:20.540
and they’ll give him some Nightwing stories.

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:26.479
Arrow does a good job of taking comic book
stories and repurposing them in interesting

00:05:26.479 --> 00:05:27.479
ways.

00:05:27.479 --> 00:05:30.300
So there aren’t a lot of direct page to
page adaptations, but I think Roy will be

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.530
doing some very Nightwing-like things.

00:05:32.530 --> 00:05:36.580
I know everyone wants Robbie Amell to be Nightwing
on the show, now that Tomorrow People has

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:37.580
been cancelled.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:42.220
Number 6 - There will be no Nightwing On Arrow,
no Dick Grayson that is

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:44.819
That’s basically the role Roy inhabits.

00:05:44.819 --> 00:05:47.630
He’s the Nightwing to Oliver’s Batman.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:53.570
But I do think we’ll see another superhero
from the comics, and the main villain of course.

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:57.230
But I don’t think we’ll be seeing a ton
of Batman characters beyond what we’ve already

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:58.300
seen.

00:05:58.300 --> 00:06:03.099
Gotham on Fox is basically using all those
people and for another show to use them too,

00:06:03.099 --> 00:06:05.710
it would be just way too crazy.

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.669
The League of Assassins doesn’t count.

00:06:07.669 --> 00:06:11.580
Because Arrow kind of claimed them in primetime
first.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.840
Number 7 - Laurel will get a lot Closer to
Black Canary

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:18.930
I don’t want to say Black Canary outright,
she could be White Canary, so Sara could still

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:19.930
inhabit the character.

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:23.800
But Kate Cassidy said in a recent interview
that she had been upping her workout regimen

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:29.100
and she felt like Sara passed the torch to
Laurel in the finale when she gave her the

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:30.100
jacket.

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:35.440
So I think that means we’ll see Laurel do
some hands on crime fighting, not necessarily

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:39.569
as Black Canary, but I do think she’ll take
a much more proactive role in taking down

00:06:39.569 --> 00:06:43.910
freak of the week villains.

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:49.159
A lot of you asked about who would train her,
I think Oliver is the only person for that

00:06:49.159 --> 00:06:51.319
job.

00:06:51.319 --> 00:06:55.530
Number 8 - Crossovers With The Flash

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:59.790
Stephen Amell already confirmed he was in
the pilot episode as we saw in the trailer.

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:03.919
But there will be characters bouncing back
and forth between both shows.

00:07:03.919 --> 00:07:06.539
Those will take two different forms.

00:07:06.539 --> 00:07:11.169
The most important kind will be episodes like
the pilot and the two-parter on Arrow where

00:07:11.169 --> 00:07:12.789
they introduced the Barry Allen character.

00:07:12.789 --> 00:07:16.900
Those will involve the lead characters Stephen
Amell and Grant Gustin going on each other

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:17.900
shows.

00:07:17.900 --> 00:07:23.670
I’m only expecting that to happen in two
episodes of the flash and two episodes of

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:24.670
Arrow.

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:27.780
Probably one big story broken into two or
four parts.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:31.129
Like the reason Oliver goes to central city
will also be part of the reason Barry comes

00:07:31.129 --> 00:07:32.620
to Starling City.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:39.730
The other kind of crossover will be like episode
19, where you have one or more secondary character

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.730
visiting.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:44.189
This would be like Felicity visiting Barry,
but not Oliver.

00:07:44.189 --> 00:07:46.039
And Caitlin Snow and Cisco visiting Felicity,
but not Barry.

00:07:46.039 --> 00:07:47.039
You get the idea.

00:07:47.039 --> 00:07:49.490
It’s not confirmed how many episodes of
The Flash we’ll get, but I’m expecting

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:52.409
a full season pick up with 23 episodes.

00:07:52.409 --> 00:07:56.949
So I think only about 3 or four of those will
be crossovers of varying degrees.

00:07:56.949 --> 00:07:58.389
And the same goes for Arrow.

00:07:58.389 --> 00:08:06.460
It’s not going to be like an every week
kind of thing.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:09.660
Number 9 - More Suicide Squad and ARGUS

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:12.990
Amanda Waller is a key component of Oliver’s
new flashbacks.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:16.629
So naturally she has to become a bigger part
of the present day story.

00:08:16.629 --> 00:08:18.870
And where there’s Amanda Waller, there’s
the Suicide Squad.

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:21.430
Plus Diggle and Lyla are having a baby.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:24.909
I think that pregnancy will probably run across
the course of the season.

00:08:24.909 --> 00:08:29.169
It just seems like her going into labor during
the climax of the season would be a good story

00:08:29.169 --> 00:08:30.180
beat to hit.

00:08:30.180 --> 00:08:32.380
But Oliver’s child is a bit of a wild card.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:35.332
In know a lot of you have been commenting
that it was a throwaway moment just meant

00:08:35.332 --> 00:08:40.720
to show us how Moira was really a good person,
but with the mother raising the child in Central

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:44.450
City, I just feel like a 7 year old Connor
Hawke would be too much fun to visit in an

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:45.630
Arrow Flash crossover.

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:47.840
I’m not expecting to see him a lot though.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:51.720
But fingers crossed that we get a casting
announcement for a 7 year old looking actor

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:52.830
on the show.

00:08:52.830 --> 00:09:00.360
and 
Number 10 - The New Big Bad

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:07.390
So Stephen Amell teased the new villain by
comparing them to Slade.

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:14.750
He said where Slade had been omnipresent - meaning
everywhere at the same time, this new villain

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:18.250
would be much less so.

00:09:18.250 --> 00:09:23.410
I think what he meant was that you had Slade
who existed in all points and times of the

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:27.500
story, he was all up in Team Arrow’s face
in the present, and he was a core part of

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.970
Oliver’s time on the Island.

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:34.400
So in season 2, there was never a moment when
Slade wasn’t right next to him or watching

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:35.970
him from a distance.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:41.870
The new villain is probably going to be someone
Oliver hasn’t met yet.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:44.670
Someone who isn’t directly tied to him in
the way Slade was.

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:45.670
It will be much less personal.

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:47.250
Based on that we can eliminate Merlyn.

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.830
Because he’s almost close enough to be Oliver’s
father.

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:52.000
And through Thea, they’re even linked by
blood.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:59.020
I also think saying the villain won’t be
omnipresent means it won’t necessarily be

00:09:59.020 --> 00:10:01.250
HIVE, the organization that is.

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:03.050
It will still be one person.

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:06.980
I do expect them to stick with tradition and
use someone from the comics, but the list

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:10.140
of viable threats that fit the bill is pretty
small.

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:17.770
There’s Vandal Savage, Ra’s Al Ghul, Doctor
Light, Amanda Waller, China White or Maxwell

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:18.770
Lord.

00:10:18.770 --> 00:10:22.870
Amanda Waller is the long shot, and really
I expect their choice to be someone practical,

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:25.610
without crazy superpowers.

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:30.440
Doctor Light would be a way for them to connect
both Arrow and Flash season finales though.

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:35.230
Even though Zoom is the Flash Big Bad, I think
it’s possible that they could put off a

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:43.820
showdown between him and Barry till season
2.

00:10:43.820 --> 00:10:47.300
But now it’s your turn, let me know who
you want the villain to be, remember.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:51.510
Think about someone who exists in both the
Flash and Arrow universes.

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.780
Or at least in the Justice League Universe.

00:10:53.780 --> 00:11:00.980
I’ll be doing a Q&amp;A tomorrow like normal,
so leave me all your questions.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:02.910
I’ll be traveling so I’ll probably be
posting it late.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:06.060
Plus there’s also a new trailer for Big
Hero Six.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.470
I’ll try to do a video for that too.

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:14.980
It’s the first animated movie Disney is
doing with Marvel since they bought the company.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:19.230
Right now click here for my breakdown of the
Flash trailer and click here for the Q&amp;A.

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:20.850
I’ll add the annotation as soon as I post
it.

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:21.850
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:21.852
High Fives!

